//=============================================================================
// maps/m5l1a_opm.scr - OpenMoHAA add-on for m5l1a
//
// It is raining when the level starts: global/weather.scr takes its rain,
// wind and thunder from these level variables when the level has set them,
// and eases on from there to its patterns (from dry, it took a minute).
//
// An add-on (Level::StartMapAddon) and not a change to maps/m5l1a.scr: a
// savegame keeps a script thread's place as an offset into the compiled map
// script, so adding lines to it sent every thread of a save made before into
// the middle of other code (a game crash at the sniper). Runs at level start,
// before weather.scr reads these, and again whenever a save is loaded, when
// they are already set and it leaves them.
//=============================================================================

	if (level.raindensity != NIL)
		end

	level.windtime = 3
	level.shuttertime = 0.2
	level.rainvolume = 0.4
	level.raindensity = 3
	level.thundertime = 6
end
